  "id": "collective-self-esteem",
  "term": "collective self-esteem",
  "definition": "Collective self-esteem is a person’s sense of worth tied to their social group or group identity. When it is impaired, people may feel more socially disconnected and more likely to take in others’ devaluing views as self-stigma.",
